{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026908nnuCDzG1794410691.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>灣仔錫克教廟慶祝傳統節慶，廟宇外牆掛滿如藍海的燈飾，吸引不少市民到場拍照。</p><p></p><p>位於皇后大道東的錫克教廟，近期每晚約六時半起，它都會閃閃發亮，原本白色外牆，掛滿藍色燈泡，在周邊建築及車來車往的道路，顯得格外鮮明，人人停低腳步，只為拍下夢幻的場景。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SIKHISM-2200_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wNEOywsmKW1794408695.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>盧小姐說：「見網上有人說這位置很漂亮，之前都沒有來過，下了班就過來拍一拍。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-11-23h23m15s010.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Oy2vt4ihdL1794410714.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>梁小朋友說：「漂亮，因為我喜歡藍色，很像(魔雪奇緣)愛莎的城堡。」</p><p></p><p>打扮成同色系的動漫角色，拍出來的相片又會否特別些？</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-11-23h23m27s687.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qNeu6wlAIU1794410731.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>馮小姐說：「我覺得真的很漂亮，而且一年只有這十多天，所以很難得，所以專程扮演這角色。本身都不知道，因今年太多人拍攝這裡，在這建築物打卡拍照才知道。」</p><p></p><p>錫克教廟代表指，掛滿燈飾是慶祝傳統節日「囚徒解放日」，與坊間所指的印度教排燈節不同，但兩者都以燈飾，象徵光明戰勝黑暗。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-11-23h24m05s750.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zf0fJzGoMA1794410746.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>錫克教廟代表Simranjit Kaur說：「世界各地的錫克教廟，都會用燈光布置慶祝，可以選擇不同顏色的用上不同燈泡或蠟燭，點起光源就可。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-11-11-23h23m35s835.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eVpAPM83JE1794410761.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>錫克教廟代表又指，這裡的燈飾會開放至本月30日，慶祝另一個節日。亦歡迎不同地區及宗教人士到訪，分享祝福之餘，亦可以了解節日意義。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:21:17.808545+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":491,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:48:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T19:07:30.155907+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:30.666253+00:00","content_hash":"36c886a20e315e94ac40df0e5411c5860d089a5dc0b6185404927eb25d680dfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T16:21:17.808545+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}